WEBVTT

00:00:00.499 --> 00:00:08.137
Namaste. Is video mein teen naye kaam. Pharmacy mein, dawai khatam ho to usi salt ki doosri dawai.

00:00:08.137 --> 00:00:15.932
Lab mein, har sample par barcode wala sticker. Aur gym, salon aur clinic ke liye WhatsApp reminders.

00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:18.270
Pehle pharmacy ka public demo.

00:00:18.657 --> 00:00:22.799
New bill par ab dawai uske salt se bhi milti hai.

00:00:22.799 --> 00:00:30.828
Paracetamol 650 likha, to Dolo 650 aur Calpol 650 dono aa gaye, kyunki dono mein wahi salt hai.

00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:38.289
Grahak Dolo 650 maang raha hai, par stock khatam hai.

00:00:38.289 --> 00:00:45.533
Chunte hi app batata hai: same salt, same strength ki Calpol 650 stock mein hai, itne ki.

00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:50.986
Give this instead dabate hi bill mein Dolo ki jagah Calpol aa gayi.

00:00:51.365 --> 00:00:57.186
Aur jis dawai ke doosre brand hain, bill ki line par Same salt likha aata hai.

00:00:57.186 --> 00:01:02.111
Dabane par saare brand daam aur stock ke saath, sabse sasta pehle.

00:01:02.111 --> 00:01:06.216
Chemist grahak ko sasta ya uplabdh vikalp de sakta hai.

00:01:06.611 --> 00:01:11.547
Ab lab. Order kholte hain. Upar naya button Sample labels.

00:01:11.547 --> 00:01:16.738
Yahan har sample ka ek sticker: blood ka alag, urine ka alag.

00:01:16.738 --> 00:01:24.822
Mareez ka naam, umar, sample, tests, samay aur barcode. Label roll ya A4 sheet, aur kitni copy.

00:01:29.316 --> 00:01:35.615
Lab mein tube aate hi Lab orders mein sticker scan karo. Order seedha khul jaata hai.

00:01:35.615 --> 00:01:39.247
Naam, phone ya order number se bhi khoj sakte ho.

00:01:41.437 --> 00:01:43.112
Ab WhatsApp reminders.

00:01:43.112 --> 00:01:52.018
Gym ke demo mein Reminders kholte hi Memberships tab: jinki membership saat din mein khatam hogi, ya abhi khatam hui.

00:01:52.018 --> 00:01:58.488
Har naam ke saamne Remind. Dabate hi WhatsApp par renew ka message taiyaar milta hai.

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:13.261
Salon aur clinic mein Tomorrow's appointments tab. Kal kis-kis ka appointment hai, kis service ka, kitne baje.

00:02:13.261 --> 00:02:19.691
Select all karke ek-ek karke bhejo. Bheja hua naam din bhar ke liye Sent dikhta hai.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:30.827
To aaj: salt se dawai aur uska substitute, lab sample par barcode sticker, aur gym, salon, clinic ke WhatsApp reminders.

00:02:30.827 --> 00:02:31.731
Dhanyavaad.
